ement the owner-authorized contract of 2026-09-18: claim every member\n  before manifest verification and hold the claims through transport;\n  immediately re-read every member ref after a successful push. Record\n  moved refs and claim-list evidence as contract violations, and withhold\n  the tooling's merged mark for those members. Later member commits are\n  absent from main.\n- State the accepted advertisement-to-commit window explicitly in the\n  protocol and dated EVOLUTION amendment. This contract requires no\n  server-side predicate for unchanged member refs. Ordinary single-PR\n  merges retain their existing path.\n\n### Testing\n- Exact-head CI passed all nine contexts in393 seconds on `7927d7aa`.\n  The rooted blueprint axiom audit passed1659 declarations with zero\n  failures and three existing statement-level warnings.\n- Normal amendment/refresh hooks, full pre-push validation, the explicitly\n  authorized old-SHA leased publication and public-head readback passed.\n  The original6122bb19 remains on a recovery ref. The cleanup removes one\n  duplicate empty incident heading and shortens the commit subjects;\n  the amended contract body is preserved and the refresh was conflict-free.\n- Independent review5243821755 inspected the full contribution on6122bb19\n  and ran six claim/transport/moved-member fixtures, all passing in24s.\n  A fresh bounded cleanup/integration recheck remains pending. No live\n  GitHub train was exercised.\n\n---\nCloses #502\n", "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:51:54Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T03:44:44Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "b20e28040bf5df4efb5b52e4818d1f70087a361b", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathemati